  (text "CONNECTOR INDEX (reference = auto-numbered; see BOM)\nPower: sheet 01-02 | Jetson IF: 03 | MCU: 04 | Drives/encoders: 05 | Sensors: 06 | Audio: 07 | Buses/debug: 08 | Safety: 09" (at 15.24 46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "98282755-ef67-5d95-aecd-cc6b24f010c0"))
  (text "GROUNDING\nGND_PWR: battery, drives, safety 24V, motors. GND_LOGIC: compute, MCU, sensors. GND_AUDIO: amp.\nJoined at single points by net ties (02: PWR/LOGIC, 07: LOGIC/AUDIO). Chassis bond: TBD." (at 152.39 46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f84177e7-3987-5bc0-90a5-e8631810d76b"))
  (text "WIRING RULES\nMotor leads: twisted pairs, short, fused per branch. Signals: twisted/shielded away from VMOT.\nWire gauge = f(peak current, length, temperature) - computed after peak current known (docs)." (at 260.14 46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b393e009-429e-5c06-904a-4c3f731fec35"))
